A CLI for everything to do with baby measurement percentiles.

Usage: centiles [COMMAND]

Commands:
  weight  Work out weight, age or centile from the other two.
  height  Work out length or height, age or centile from the other two.
  head    Work out head circumference, age or centile from the other two.
  help    Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
      --version  Display application version.
  -h, --help     Print help
